</div>
<div class="h-1/2 rounded-xl overflow-hidden group">
<img class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" data-alt="A glass of red wine against a dark background" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBfLrgeVCweqvidX7Bg0j5pJYkjNBDCXz89F2R_tg8HXiBFuQ3T9F9Xlb2bce-hUl5GDaVDn0sj_o2RSlCJcSdWU6S5031VBPChBpgxW1cpiLxGFFQWb1VC4nz8rQuggdsJ-u0lB5i63UG-DhrfvtMW7U99UQtJeucHXSo0-W1aMmio5VGk0KIkdWdbSLCudLPqjfooTLxXz3RuO_0SMWcWKbdff6pUczvbrL4CT01c0YperFvYrSWDwcMtnQP7XxdNt4Vpz7fpBew"/>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="space-y-6 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-lg font-light">
<p>
                            As we concluded our afternoon, we walked through the 'Library'—a collection of bottles dating back to Marco's grandfather's time. Each bottle represents a different era of the family, a different climate, and a different struggle. To drink a Valenti wine is to consume a piece of history.
                        </p>
</div>
<!-- CTA Section -->
<div class="bg-charcoal-light rounded-lg p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 border border-white/5">
<div class="text-center md:text-left">
<h4 class="text-2xl font-display text-white">Experience the Valenti Estate</h4>
<p class="text-slate-400 mt-2 font-body">Private tours and vertical tastings available by appointment.</p>
</div>
<button class="bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 text-white font-bold py-4 px-10 rounded-lg transition-all uppercase tracking-widest text-sm shadow-lg shadow-primary/20">
                            Book a Tour
                        </button>
</div>
</div>
</article>
